  <section id="s4">
    <div class="section-tag">History</div>
    <h2>4. IT Act 2000 — Overview &amp; History</h2>

    <p>The <strong>Information Technology Act, 2000</strong> (IT Act 2000) is India's primary law governing cyberspace, electronic commerce, and cybercrime. It was enacted on <strong>17th October 2000</strong> and came into force making India one of the first developing nations to pass comprehensive cyber legislation.</p>

